{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/056797bf54eeb9a99df08588a9fba074.avif?t=1761392808\" width=1560 height=339 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trenches VR \u2013 A Psychological WWI Survival Horror, where enemies hear your microphone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trenches VR</strong> puts you in the boots of a World War I soldier trapped behind enemy lines. In this claustrophobic nightmare, fight for your life \u2014 and your sanity \u2014 as you navigate the horrors of war. Your only goal is to return to your family. Your only tools is an old trench whistle and your instincts to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game contains disturbing imagery, intense jump scares, and psychological horror not suitable for all players. Play at your own risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies can</strong> <strong>hear your voice, breathing, and every move </strong>that you make through your microphone. Stay quiet, stay hidden\u2026 or they\u2019ll find you. Collect clues, uncover the truth, and use your whistle to guide your way - but beware, every sound could give away your position.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/07e5f8c49a6dd1a98c24903eaec116a1.avif?t=1761392808\" width=1560 height=339 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/56c272e1f8516b5258f8c72ba6623c98.poster.avif?t=1761392808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/56c272e1f8516b5258f8c72ba6623c98.webm?t=1761392808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/56c272e1f8516b5258f8c72ba6623c98.mp4?t=1761392808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Insanity:</strong> Just because you passed somewhere already, does not mean that there is nothing there. The environment may change with your sanity.  <br><br><strong>Repeatability:</strong> Experience may change for each player. Fog type, some parts of the environment, jump-scares and objectives location will be randomized on each play-through.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan Accordingly:</strong> Plan your next move as it may be your last. Peak around corners, watch your footsteps as some wooden floors creak, and be always on the move.  <br><br><strong>Microphone Input:</strong> Enemy can listen and hear your microphone, screams and sounds. Make sure to not scream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mark Walls:</strong> With the chalk you find in the trenches, leave your mark on the walls\u2014your drawings will guide you when you\u2019re lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/1c6f6034ad275f85dfe13065f5442f6d.poster.avif?t=1761392808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/1c6f6034ad275f85dfe13065f5442f6d.webm?t=1761392808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/1c6f6034ad275f85dfe13065f5442f6d.mp4?t=1761392808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/94d6957f4cce4ec3b07dcf9680271bce.poster.avif?t=1761392808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/94d6957f4cce4ec3b07dcf9680271bce.webm?t=1761392808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/94d6957f4cce4ec3b07dcf9680271bce.mp4?t=1761392808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2687660?t=1761392808","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761392808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761392808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761392808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains jumpscares, loud sounds, fear, blood and gore that some audience may find disturbing. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/056797bf54eeb9a99df08588a9fba074.avif?t=1761392808\" width=1560 height=339 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trenches VR \u2013 A Psychological WWI Survival Horror, where enemies hear your microphone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trenches VR</strong> puts you in the boots of a World War I soldier trapped behind enemy lines. In this claustrophobic nightmare, fight for your life \u2014 and your sanity \u2014 as you navigate the horrors of war. Your only goal is to return to you